# Answer 8 · Gender-Based Violence Defined; Its Forms in Pakistan; Practical Strategies to Eradicate It (CSS 2023)
@py question 2023-8

## The answer map
::: fig mindmap | The answer map: every branch is one numbered heading of the model answer below.
@note Three parts: a precise definition with theory, the forms of violence in Pakistan grouped by nature and backed by data, and practical strategies organised level by level with a realistic order of priorities.
@ask ① DEFINE gender-based violence
@ask ② EXPLAIN various FORMS of violence against women in PAKISTAN
@ask ③ DEVISE PRACTICAL STRATEGIES helpful in ERADICATING GBV from our society
